# =============================================================================
#  CUI-CPP.orch - Company Performance Prediction (MPAI-CUI, CPP V2.1)
#  Workflow Description Language v0.3, AIF V3.0
#
#  One Controller, one Module - Company Performance Prediction, 1CUI-CPP-V2.1-I01 - which executes
#  continuously: its AIMs (Financial and Governance Assessment, Primary Default Prediction, Organisation
#  Model Assessment, Primary Discontinuity Prediction, Risk Matrix Generation, Prediction Result
#  Perturbation) feed one another, and what one gives another is the Topology's business, never the
#  User Agent's. The User Agent binds a device to every Port of the Module's boundary, each to one Port,
#  by Data Type and Port Number:
#
#    what the analyst gives the Module -
#      Horizon (number)                  the Prediction Horizon, in months
#      Financial (CUI-FND)               the Financial Descriptors of the company
#      Governance (CUI-GVS)              its Governance Descriptors
#      Climate (CUI-LRD)                 the Climate Risk Descriptors of where it operates   (optional)
#      Cyber (CUI-CRD)                   its Cyber Risk Descriptors                         (optional)
#      SecondaryRisks (CUI-SRS)          the Secondary Risk Statements                      (optional)
#
#    what the Module gives -
#      Organisation (CUI-ORD)            what the organisation does to the probability of default
#      PrimaryDefault (CUI-PDD)          the probability of default within the Horizon, and the importance
#                                        of each Financial Descriptor to it
#      PrimaryDiscontinuity (CUI-PSD)    the probability that operations are interrupted, by risk
#      SecondaryProbability (number)     the Secondary Discontinuity Probability                (optional)
#
#  The User Agent names no AIM and knows nothing of the Module but its boundary; the model the Prediction
#  AIMs use is the Module's business too (Access data the Controller obtains).
# =============================================================================

workflow CUI-CPP over 1CUI-CPP-V2.1-I01

on Start:

    ask Controller to start

    stream  Horizon         (number)        from device "Horizon"
    stream  Financial       (CUI-FND-V2.1)  from device "Financial"
    stream  Governance      (CUI-GVS-V2.1)  from device "Governance"
    stream  Climate         (CUI-LRD-V2.1)  from device "Climate"
    stream  Cyber           (CUI-CRD-V2.1)  from device "Cyber"
    stream  SecondaryRisks  (CUI-SRS-V2.1)  from device "SecondaryRisks"

    deliver Organisation          (CUI-ORD-V2.1)  to device "Report"
    deliver PrimaryDefault        (CUI-PDD-V2.1)  to device "Report"
    deliver PrimaryDiscontinuity  (CUI-PSD-V2.1)  to device "Report"
    deliver SecondaryProbability  (number)        to device "Report"

    loop until Stop:
        wait 1s

on Stop:
    ask Controller to stop
